[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Document cron persistence `` `/disk/etc/cron.d/docker-mon:5` ``
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Uncover silent systemd persistence `` `/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:5` ``
